@startuml
title Storyteller API and Web - Flow Design

start
:Receive HTTP or HTTPS request in Javalin;
:Resolve opaque session cookie or API session id;
if (active session exists?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Return API error or redirect to start page;
  stop
endif

if (story turn?) then (yes)
  :Normalize prompt and validate optional image;
  :Load session-owned system prompt,\nfixed protagonists, rules and canonical state from H2;
  :Load recent messages from H2;
  if (old exchanges selected?) then (yes)
    :Verify maximum 3 and outside recent context;
    :Load complete exchanges from H2;
    :Mark them explicitly as earlier story excerpts;
  endif
  :Build messages with Core prompt builder;
  :Attach optional image to current user message;
  :Request draft from model backend;
  if (validation enabled?) then (yes)
    :Validate using session rules\nand fixed protagonists;
    :Use ALLOW draft or REPLACE text;
  else (no)
    :Sanitize and use draft;
  endif
  :Store prompt, response and optional image in H2;
  :Schedule serialized summary and\ncanonical-state refreshes in H2;
  :Render updated JTE page or return JSON;
elseif (history page?) then (yes)
  :Load one older page of exchanges from H2;
  :Render JTE fragment for infinite scrolling;
elseif (settings?) then (yes)
  :Load or update session prompts\nand canonical state;
  :Validate fixed protagonists YAML before save;
elseif (memory history?) then (yes)
  :Render mid-term and long-term\nsummaries read-only from H2;
elseif (import or export?) then (yes)
  :Read or create session ZIP including\noptional prompts and images;
else (session action)
  :Create, undo, keep indefinitely,\nor permanently delete session;
endif
stop
@enduml
